  "releaseNotes": "- Renderer: HDR to SDR improvements for HDR10 / HDR10+ / HLG / Dolby Vision (still not dynamic changes support)\n\t\t- Renderer: Adds Dolby Vision HDR to SDR support (for Profiles 7.1 - HDR10, 8.1 - HDR10, 8.4 - HLG)\n\t\t- Renderer: Introduces Spline Tonemap (which replaces previous Aces, Hable, Reinhard)\n\t\t- Renderer: Color precision improvements for YUV to RGB limited\n\t\t- Renderer: Add embedded source ICC profile support\n\t\t- Renderer: Fixes possible crashes with SuperResolution and non-YUV formats\n\t\t- Config.Video: Introduces HDRBrightness as the new tonemap's adjustment\n\t\t- Player: Fixes audio only usage\n\t\t- Engine.Audio: Handle missing default audio device gracefully\n\n\t\t[Breaking Changes]\n\t\t- Config.Video: Deprecates HDRtoSDRMethod\n\t\t- Config.Video: Deprecates SDRDisplayNits",
